API.md E1 (log-2026-09-29 M4, "E1 vs E21 order"): each operation resolves against the state
the previous ones left; a path under a value that fails to compute in that state is ErrNoValue,
even when the edit would be valid as a whole.
-- options --
pkgs: p
-- edit.json --
{"ops": [
  {"op": "set", "path": "pick", "value": 7},
  {"op": "set", "path": "picked", "value": 0}
]}
-- project.canon --
project acme {
  canon: "0.1"
}
-- p/p.canon --
package p

/// Values.
let values: [Int] = [1, 2, 3]

/// Which value.
let pick: Int = 1

/// The picked value.
let picked: Int = values[pick]
-- result.json --
{
  "error": "op 1: value not computed at segment -1"
}
